    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Modekayi ŵaŵendile cikamucisyo ca Esitele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Modekayi piŵamanyilile yosope yiyatendekwagayo, jwalakwe ŵapapwile yakuwala yakwe ligongo lya canasa. Kaneko ŵawete cisaka nipo ŵalipakesye liwu mu mtwe kulosya kuti ŵakwete canasa cekulungwa. Ŵajesile mkati mwa msinda aku ali mkulila mwa canasa soni mwakwesya maloŵe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵajile kukwima pa cipata cakwinjilila ku nyumba ja mwenye ligongo lyakuti pangali mundu jwalijose jwam'wale yisaka juŵakundidwaga kwinjila mkati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ma upande gosope kwele kulyaŵalanjidwe lilamusi lya mwenye lila, kwapali kulila sikati ja Ayuda, mwakuti ŵalijimile kulya, ŵalisile, ŵadandawile ni canasa nipo Ayuda ŵajinji ŵawete yisaka ni kugona pa liwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aciŵali ŵakumtumicila Esitele pamo ni ŵakutumicila ŵacele ŵala piŵayice ni kwasalila yiŵatendaga Modekayi, ŵamkwawo mwenyewo ŵalasile mnope mu mtima, mwakuti ŵatumisye yakuwala kuti Modekayi akawale m'malo mwa yisaka yiŵaweteyo. Nambo jwalakwejo nganakunda yeleyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Esitele ŵamŵilasile Hataki jumo jwa ŵakutumicila ŵa mwenye juŵasagulidwe kuti amtumicileje Esitele, nipo ŵamlamwile jwalakwejo kuti ajawule kwa Modekayi akapikane kuti yeleyi yatendekwe ligongo cici. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Hataki ŵapite kwa Modekayi pa luŵala lwa msinda pasogolo pa cipata cakwinjilila ku nyumba ja mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Modekayi ŵamsalile jwalakwejo yosope yiyatendeceyo, ŵasalile soni ya ciŵalanjilo ca mbiya ciŵatite Hamani kuti tacipeleka ku misaku ja cipanje ca mwenye ni cakulinga cakuti mwenyewo ŵatendekasye jemanjajo kuti ŵawulaje Ayudawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Modekayi ŵapele soni Hataki cikalata cicalembedwepo lilamusilyo cele mwenye ŵacitumisye kutyocela ku Susa, cakulamula kuti Ayuda wosope awulajidwe. Modekayi ŵamdandawulile Hataki kuti ajigale cikalataco akacilosye kwa Esitele ni kwalongosolela muyiŵelele yindu, nipo akasalile kuti ŵelewo ajawule kwa mwenye kukumdandawulila ni kumŵenda kuti ŵatendele canasa ŵandu ŵawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hataki ŵapite kukwasalila Esitele yiŵaŵecete Modekayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Esitele ŵaŵecete ni Hataki nipo ŵapele utenga wakuti akasalile Modekayi kuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naga mundu akusaka kwawula kukumlola mwenye, pana lilamusi lyakwe. Naga mundu jwalijose, jwamlume kapena jwamkongwe akwinjila mu luŵala lwa mkati ku nyumba ja mwenye mkanamŵilanje, pana lilamusi limpepe lyakuti, wosopewo akwenela kuwulajidwa, akaŵe ajo pejo mwenye jwamlanjisye mwenye ni simbo jakwe ja ucimwene ja golidi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwelejo ngawulajidwa. Nambo unetu nganambilanga mwenye kuti njawule ngawonegane nawo. Kutyocela pa ndaŵi jiŵambilasile une mwenye kuwonegana nawo papite mwesi umo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Modekayi piŵapocele utenga wakutyocela kwa Esitele, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŵelewo ŵatumile Hataki kuti ajawule soni kwa Esitele kukwasalila kuti: “Mkaganisya kuti m'mwejo jikape ni ŵitimcikulupuka kwapunda Ayuda ŵane wosope ligongo lyakuti mli ku Nyumba ja mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuti naga mkutama ngaŵeceta cilicose pa ndaŵi mpela jejino, ni kuti cikamucisyo ni cikulupusyo ca Ayuda ticicityocela kwine, nambo m'mwejo pampepe ni ŵa mwiŵasa lya baba ŵenu timciwulajidwa. Yili yakomboleka kuti m'mwejo mwaŵele ŵamkwawo mwenye ligongo lya ndaŵi mpela jeleji kuti mtukulupusye uwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
